%% Diagram: Ecomdy Observability Architecture
%% ID: ECOMDY-D30 | Version: 0.1 | State: Target proposal; thresholds TBD
flowchart LR
  jobs["Ingestion / processing jobs"] --> telemetry["Structured status, timing and error metadata"]
  ai["AI task runs"] --> telemetry
  editorial["Review / approval actions"] --> telemetry
  telemetry --> metrics["Coverage, freshness, latency, failures and cost"]
  telemetry --> logs["Access-controlled, minimized logs"]
  metrics --> dashboard["Operational view · implementation TBD"]
  metrics --> alerts["Owner-defined alert thresholds · TBD"]
  logs --> incident["Investigation and recovery workflow"]
